  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates><x>0</x><y>760</y><w>1400</w><h>60</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Dependency rule in every service: presentation -&gt; application -&gt; domain &lt;- infrastructure (spec-01 s2.2). Ports follow the pattern: declared in domain for Domain Model services, in application for sales-
service and insight-service (ADR 0002); repository interfaces live in infrastructure.repository (ADR 0005). Invariants live in the innermost layer the pattern provides: the aggregate for Domain Model, the
transaction script for sales-service, and the RiskAssessmentPolicy domain service for insight-service (spec-01 s2.5, ADR 0006).
bg=#FFFBE6</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
</diagram>
